Short source-landscape note: the 2023 Bangladesh environment for Sheikh Hasina is heavily documented across election integrity, opposition repression, press freedom, cyber-law, civic-space, and UN/NGO reporting. The strongest candidate families are election bodies, UN/OHCHR, HRW, Amnesty, Freedom House, CIVICUS, RSF, local reporting, and a smaller set of academic/legal analyses. I found more than 30 distinct candidate URLs, including favorable/official, adverse, and mixed leads.

